POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Unauthenticated message"
}

### Non-participant attempts to read A-B messages - expected 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{thirdToken}}

### Non-participant attempts to send into A-B conversation - expected 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{thirdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Forbidden message"
}

